[G5 RESULT] SECURE — a rejected git op right after an allowed operation in the same mission leaves refs, events, action records, and files untouched. OBSERVED (DF1 footprint): a git call that PASSES authorization (legacy validator) crashes in the implementation but leaves audit traces — ActionRequested + ActionValidated(false) + TOOL_FAILED events and a failed Action record — which is audit-trail growth, not an operational side effect
